msgctxt "STRINGS.MOONO.TWEAKS.ROWS.UPDATE_CHECK.DETAIL"
msgid "Asks GitHub (api.github.com) for Moono's releases at most once every 6 hours, in the background. Nothing about you or your game is sent. The answer is kept in the oni-moono data folder. Off: Moono makes no network requests."
